Now tear your nails!

262
00:18:23,040 --> 00:18:23,917
Cover your toes!

263
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:25,220
Rip off your ears!

264
00:18:25,760 --> 00:18:27,780
You'll pay in body parts for that!

265
00:18:27,940 --> 00:18:29,277
What do you want us to take, boss?

266
00:18:29,360 --> 00:18:30,190
And how many?

267
00:18:30,480 --> 00:18:31,780
Just give us the word!

268
00:18:31,900 --> 00:18:33,057
Don't take anything!

269
00:18:33,140 --> 00:18:34,437
That man saved my life!

270
00:18:34,520 --> 00:18:35,873
Put him down right now!

271
00:18:42,320 --> 00:18:43,700
Don't you worry, boss.

272
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:45,117
If there are any rebels left,

273
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:49,357
we'll find them and bring them to your
side, no matter where they're hiding.

274
00:18:49,440 --> 00:18:51,740
Splendid. Do your best. Yes, sir.

275
00:18:52,800 --> 00:18:55,340
Seems you escaped death, kid. For today.

276
00:18:55,940 --> 00:19:00,340
I hope you learned your lesson for
next time. Shut up! You're lame!

277
00:19:08,660 --> 00:19:09,820
My word!

278
00:19:10,200 --> 00:19:11,320
What a surprise!

279
00:19:11,700 --> 00:19:15,994
To think you were the mystery man from
Kuri who stole Kaido's blueprints!

280
00:19:16,400 --> 00:19:17,230
How fortunate!

281
00:19:17,313 --> 00:19:19,037
Long have we searched for this!

282
00:19:19,120 --> 00:19:21,820
The layout of the mansion on Onigashima!

283
00:19:22,760 --> 00:19:26,320
A shame that I wasted so
much of Surfer Nosuke's time.

284
00:19:27,220 --> 00:19:31,200
But now, we can plan our
attack on enemy territory!

285
00:19:32,340 --> 00:19:34,200
What a reliable ally!

286
00:19:34,740 --> 00:19:37,457
When did Yugar get so conscientious?

287
00:19:37,540 --> 00:19:40,305
Are you gonna keep saying
that every time, dog?

288
00:19:45,740 --> 00:19:48,420
Is that you, Rizzo? What's the word?

289
00:19:48,620 --> 00:19:51,385
Have you managed to rescue
Sir Luffy Taddo yet?

290
00:19:51,860 --> 00:19:54,177
Indeed we have, but that
is only the beginning.

291
00:19:54,260 --> 00:19:58,554
I'll spare you the details for now,
but we just recruited 3,500 warriors.

292
00:20:05,500 --> 00:20:07,400
3,500 warriors?

293
00:20:07,880 --> 00:20:09,440
That's no small number.

294
00:20:09,760 --> 00:20:12,017
So you've not only saved
Sir Luffy as planned,

295
00:20:12,100 --> 00:20:15,041
you've also freed Kawamatsu
and recruited an army?

296
00:20:15,360 --> 00:20:18,220
Hold on, Kawamatsu is
locked in that prison?

297
00:20:18,420 --> 00:20:21,538
You mean the entire region
is under your control now?

298
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:25,762
You've got to have achieved far
more than a rescue mission, Raizo.

299
00:20:26,280 --> 00:20:27,320
Next stop!

300
00:20:31,860 --> 00:20:36,877
our friends are recruiting even more allies
as we speak however with that comes a

301
00:20:36,960 --> 00:20:40,517
complication which we
must address this land

302
00:20:40,600 --> 00:20:43,157
has several weapons
factories as you surely know

303
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:45,677
but their products are intended for export

304
00:20:45,760 --> 00:20:47,817
and do not stay in the
land of wano for long

305
00:20:47,900 --> 00:20:50,897
since our forces are mostly samurai they

306
00:20:50,980 --> 00:20:54,697
are skilled with swords
and spears but as you

307
00:20:54,780 --> 00:20:56,917
can imagine those are difficult to come by

308
00:20:57,000 --> 00:20:59,257
since Orochi has banned
citizens from carrying

309
00:20:59,340 --> 00:21:04,317
weapons no matter how many allies we have
if they are not properly armed our plan is

310
00:21:04,400 --> 00:21:08,757
doomed to fail very well i understand this

311
00:21:08,840 --> 00:21:10,057
is a serious matter

312
00:21:10,140 --> 00:21:11,457
what to do

313
00:21:11,540 --> 00:21:17,977
i shall give

314
00:21:18,060 --> 00:21:21,077
this quandary some
thought but i must go i'll

315
00:21:21,160 --> 00:21:23,397
inform of our group's
accomplishments later.

316
00:21:23,480 --> 00:21:28,186
For the time being, I will head to Amagasa
Village and gauge their preparedness.

317
00:21:29,080 --> 00:21:32,757
Rizo, I look forward to sharing the
details of our mutual victories.

318
00:21:32,840 --> 00:21:33,720
As do I.

319
00:21:34,280 --> 00:21:35,110
Click.

320
00:21:40,720 --> 00:21:42,460
And now, we depart.

321
00:21:47,680 --> 00:21:52,580
I can scarcely believe my eyes,
But I'd know that face anywhere.

322
00:21:54,040 --> 00:21:54,940
Kawamatsu!

323
00:22:03,400 --> 00:22:05,020
It can't be.

324
00:22:05,500 --> 00:22:08,080
Is that really you?

325
00:22:13,120 --> 00:22:14,020
Kawamatsu!

326
00:22:33,680 --> 00:22:37,460
It is you, to think I would
find you in a place like this.

327
00:22:38,280 --> 00:22:41,437
But never mind, if you are
well, that's all that matters.

328
00:22:41,520 --> 00:22:43,980
My heart leaps with joy to find you safe.

329
00:22:44,980 --> 00:22:45,940
Lady Hiyori.

330
00:22:48,080 --> 00:22:49,420
Oh yeah, that's right.

331
00:22:50,180 --> 00:22:53,757
She said something about being raised
by a cop after her parents died.

332
00:22:53,840 --> 00:22:54,840
Forgive me.

333
00:22:55,240 --> 00:22:58,960
Back then, I only ran away
because I feared for your health.

334
00:23:00,220 --> 00:23:04,867
Even if it was only a scrap, you always
gave me every morsel of food you found.

335
00:23:11,800 --> 00:23:14,680
It appears that I am still
lacking as a samurai.

336
00:23:20,060 --> 00:23:20,890
Kawamatsu!

337
00:23:21,360 --> 00:23:24,300
I couldn't stand to watch you waste away,

338
00:23:25,040 --> 00:23:28,637
especially knowing that you could
easily survive if you were alone.

339
00:23:28,720 --> 00:23:32,367
I couldn't stand the thought
that you might die because of me.

340
00:23:55,400 --> 00:24:01,660
I'm sorry for leaving you, Kawamatsu, but
if nothing is done, I fear you may die.

341
00:24:03,880 --> 00:24:07,900
It was painful, but what could I do?

342
00:24:12,060 --> 00:24:16,217
Dear Kawamatsu, thank you for everything.

343
00:24:16,300 --> 00:24:17,660
I'll be fine, Hiyori.

344
00:24:19,360 --> 00:24:20,437
Lady...

345
00:24:20,520 --> 00:24:22,360
Lady Hiyori!

346
00:24:28,200 --> 00:24:30,520
Lady Hiyori!

347
00:24:32,240 --> 00:24:33,360
Your Majesty!

348
00:24:37,660 --> 00:24:39,080
Would you believe it?

349
00:24:39,200 --> 00:24:41,376
I washed my hair all by myself today!

350
00:24:41,560 --> 00:24:43,560
All I had to do was close my eyes!

351
00:24:43,800 --> 00:24:44,920
Not here.

352
00:24:46,620 --> 00:24:47,840
Where to next?

353
00:24:56,560 --> 00:24:57,680
Lady Hiyori!

354
00:25:07,220 --> 00:25:09,980
Oh, Lady Hiyori, why'd you run away?

355
00:25:29,160 --> 00:25:31,840
My lady, please.

356
00:25:41,880 --> 00:25:43,840
Where did you go?

357
00:25:45,640 --> 00:25:48,760
What have I done wrong, my lady?

358
00:25:49,440 --> 00:25:50,270
Why?

359
00:25:56,520 --> 00:25:58,500
Come back.

360
00:25:59,060 --> 00:26:01,140
Lady Hiyori!

361
00:26:07,580 --> 00:26:09,560
I'm so sorry.

362
00:26:10,380 --> 00:26:11,960
You must have suffered.

363
00:26:12,740 --> 00:26:15,200
Now I finally know why you ran away.

364
00:26:15,720 --> 00:26:17,660
How kind of you to think of me.

365
00:26:17,880 --> 00:26:21,056
Though thanks to that, I put
on quite a lot of weight.

366
00:26:31,520 --> 00:26:32,980
Who goes there?

367
00:26:36,500 --> 00:26:38,577
Your days are numbered, Kikimari!

368
00:26:38,660 --> 00:26:42,097
You really think you could steal
our weapons and get away with it?

369
00:26:42,180 --> 00:26:44,945
I'll take them back along
with everything else!

370
00:26:48,660 --> 00:26:50,160
These are hunting rounds.

371
00:26:50,460 --> 00:26:52,695
They take down things twice your size!

372
00:26:54,140 --> 00:26:55,897
Hide behind that tree, my lady.

373
00:26:55,980 --> 00:26:56,810
I shall.

374
00:26:58,360 --> 00:26:59,190
Huh?

375
00:26:59,273 --> 00:27:00,257
Are those buddies of his?

376
00:27:00,340 --> 00:27:01,397
What does it matter?

377
00:27:01,480 --> 00:27:03,186
Just shoot them all to death!

378
00:27:04,640 --> 00:27:05,680
Go to hell!

379
00:27:13,020 --> 00:27:13,900
Ah!

380
00:27:14,540 --> 00:27:15,600
Kappa style!

381
00:27:15,800 --> 00:27:16,920
Two-sword style!

382
00:27:17,160 --> 00:27:18,460
River of Retribution!

383
00:27:18,660 --> 00:27:19,580
Rhino cycle!

384
00:27:32,020 --> 00:27:33,500
Shikawa Matsu!

385
00:27:35,920 --> 00:27:37,197
Are you alright?

386
00:27:37,280 --> 00:27:39,560
As long as you are, Lady Hiyori.

387
00:27:41,880 --> 00:27:44,480
I can't believe it's you!

388
00:27:48,280 --> 00:27:49,221
Hey, wait a sec!

389
00:27:49,560 --> 00:27:51,148
Are you running away again?

390
00:27:51,880 --> 00:27:52,710
Asshole!

391
00:27:52,793 --> 00:27:54,300
Give me my sword!

392
00:27:59,560 --> 00:28:02,280
Shikawa Matsu, it's really you!

393
00:28:02,480 --> 00:28:04,120
I'm so glad you're alive!

394
00:28:08,220 --> 00:28:09,660
Thank you.
